  "prefLabel": "Eng 103.04 Organization",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Eng 103.04 Organization. Beginning with the regular meeting in July and annually thereafter, the board shall meet and organize and, by election from among its members, select a chairperson, vice-chairperson and secretary.\n\nSource. #6910, eff 12-15-98; renumbered by #13736 (formerly Eng 103.05)",
